// The witness that started the organic-firing arc (aug13l hz1
// divergence_000000 -> Eric's 2026-08-14 rulings ->
// design/organic_firing.md). Under the old semantics the interp was
// quiet (wash-out at the const terminal) and the kernel fired per
// delivery; Eric first ruled quiet, then re-ruled the SEMANTICS:
// a node fires iff a consumed input fires — the kernel was right all
// along. Both engines now fire per delivery (4 emissions of 8).
// Formerly fuzz/known-kernel-gaps/const-terminal-changed-args/00.
{let x = array::iter([i64:0, i64:2, i64:0, i64:4]); let rec f = |n: i64| -> i64 select n {i64:0 => i64:0, _ => i64:8 - f(n % i64:1)}; f(x - i64:1)}
